IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0008.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    05 LEDGER-BAL         PIC 9(9)V99.
    05 ACCT-TYPE          PIC X.
    05 STD-RATE           PIC 9V9999.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 FINAL-RATE         PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM SENIOR-BONUS
    PERFORM 2600-FIXED-DEP
    DISPLAY "FINAL-RATE=" FINAL-RATE
    STOP RUN.
SENIOR-BONUS.
    IF CLNT-AGE >= 60 AND LEDGER-BAL >= 25000
        COMPUTE FINAL-RATE = STD-RATE + 0.0050
    ELSE
        MOVE STD-RATE TO FINAL-RATE
    END-IF.
2600-FIXED-DEP.
    IF ACCT-TYPE = 'F'
        COMPUTE FINAL-RATE = FINAL-RATE + 0.0010
    END-IF.
